- **Category hierarchy:** Non-fiction is parent to Technology, Business and Nature;
  Fiction is parent to Children Fiction.
- **Customer ↔ orders:** customer 1 has orders 1 and 4, with different destinations.
- **Order ↔ books:** order 1 has three different books; book 1 appears in orders 1 and 3.
- **Reviews:** book 1 has reviews from customers 1 and 3; customer 1 reviews several books.
